## 2. Component Diagram

```mermaid
graph TD
    %% External inputs
    EnvFile[(".env file on disk")]
    YAMLSchema[("schemas/env_schema.yaml<br/>Declarative YAML contract")]
    PySchema[("schemas/env_schema.py<br/>Python ENV_SCHEMA")]
    CLIArgs["CLI flags:<br/>--env --strict --format --schema ..."]

    %% Entry
    CLI["main.py<br/>argparse entrypoint"]

    %% Core modules
    Parser["src/validator/parser.py<br/>parse_env_file() → ParsedEnv"]
    SchemaEngine["src/validator/schema.py<br/>Schema.validate() → ValidationReport"]
    Rules["src/validator/rules.py<br/>Required / TypeCast / Pattern / MinLength"]
    Reporter["src/validator/reporter.py<br/>ConsoleReporter text / JSON"]
    Config["src/config/settings.py<br/>ValidationConfig + EnvFieldSchema + EnvType"]
    Errors["src/config/errors.py<br/>Exception hierarchy + ValidationIssue"]

    %% Outputs
    TextOut["Human-readable text report<br/>(TTY colors, emojis)"]
    JSONOut["Machine-readable JSON report<br/>(CI/CD log aggregation)"]
    ExitCode["Process exit code<br/>0 = PASS, 1 = FAIL, 2 = ERROR"]

    %% Data flow
    EnvFile --> Parser
    YAMLSchema -->|load_yaml_schema| SchemaEngine
    PySchema -->|ENV_SCHEMA / SchemaCatalog| SchemaEngine
    CLIArgs --> CLI
    CLI --> Parser
    CLI --> SchemaEngine
    Parser -->|ParsedEnv values| SchemaEngine
    Config --> SchemaEngine
    Config --> Reporter
    SchemaEngine -->|per-field values| Rules
    Rules -->|ValidationResult| SchemaEngine
    SchemaEngine -->|ValidationReport| Reporter
    Reporter --> TextOut
    Reporter --> JSONOut
    Reporter --> ExitCode
    Errors -.-> Parser
    Errors -.-> SchemaEngine
    Errors -.-> Rules
    Errors -.-> Reporter
```

