## 3. Validation Decision Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start((Start validation))
    Parse[Parse .env file]
    ParseErr{Parse error?<br/>(missing file, bad syntax)}
    Exit2[Exit code 2<br/>File / usage error]
    SchemaCheck[Validate each declared field]
    RulePipe[Rule pipeline:<br/>Required → TypeCast → Pattern → MinLength]
    AnyErr{Any rule errors?}
    Strict{Strict mode<br/>(--strict)?}
    StrictErr[Flag undeclared keys<br/>as errors]
    Report[Build ValidationReport<br/>errors + warnings + passed]
    Format{Output format?}
    JSON[JSON report]
    Text[Colored text report]
    Passed{Report passed?<br/>(no errors)}
    Exit0[Exit code 0 — PASS]
    Exit1[Exit code 1 — FAIL]

    Start --> Parse
    Parse --> ParseErr
    ParseErr -->|Yes| Exit2
    ParseErr -->|No| SchemaCheck
    SchemaCheck --> RulePipe
    RulePipe --> AnyErr
    AnyErr -->|Yes| Strict
    AnyErr -->|No| Report
    Strict -->|Yes| StrictErr
    Strict -->|No| Report
    StrictErr --> Report
    Report --> Format
    Format -->|json| JSON
    Format -->|text| Text
    JSON --> Passed
    Text --> Passed
    Passed -->|Yes| Exit0
    Passed -->|No| Exit1
```

