## 4. Module Responsibility Matrix

| Module | Responsibility | Key public API |
|:-------|:---------------|:---------------|
| `main.py` | CLI argument parsing, orchestration, exit codes | `main(argv) → int` |
| `src/validator/parser.py` | `.env` tokenization → key/value dict | `parse_env_file(path) → ParsedEnv` |
| `src/validator/schema.py` | Field declarations + rule pipeline + report | `Schema.validate(values, config) → ValidationReport` |
| `src/validator/rules.py` | Per-rule validation logic | `Rule.check(key, value, schema) → ValidationResult` |
| `src/validator/reporter.py` | Text/JSON rendering, exit-code mapping | `ConsoleReporter.report(report) → int` |
| `src/config/settings.py` | Type constants, field schema, runtime config | `EnvType`, `EnvFieldSchema`, `ValidationConfig` |
| `src/config/errors.py` | Exception hierarchy, structured issue | `ValidationIssue(key, code, message, …)` |
| `schemas/env_schema.*` | Default environment contract | `ENV_SCHEMA`, `SchemaCatalog` |
| `schemas/loader.py` | YAML schema loading | `load_yaml_schema(path) → Schema` |
